# Synthetic phases and escape reference remain prose; there is no branch traversal contract.
route "Synthetic approach and return"
start "Trailhead"
note "Approach begins; phase boundaries are descriptive only."
walk W1 distance=100m
note "Canyon entry. Escape candidate near R1; destination and connection are unresolved."
rappel R1 height=8m rope=20m anchor=natural
note "Return begins; no alternative or escape edge is implied."
walk W2 distance=50m
exit "Trailhead return"
